E AX3049 373-restrict-no-cast.ax:22:7-9 restriction-violated "`as` in the body of `fabricates`, which claims `restrict(no-cast)`" ?"`no-cast` rejects explicit conversions in this body. Use an operation that preserves the required type, or remove the restriction. `no-cast:deep` also follows resolved callees; an unresolved path cannot establish the claim."
