E AX3073 373-restrict-no-cast.ax:22:7-9 undeclared-unsafe "`fabricates` erases `Meters` into `Int` with `as`, and its declaration does not say so" #"erases a reference" ^22:10-11:"source has type `Meters`; the conversion drops its ownership" ?21:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(unsafe)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(unsafe)\n" ?"keep the value in a typed binding, or use `addrOf` when the question is identity. An erasing cast drops the type and the share" ?"the unsafe tag marks a trusted boundary: you must make every well-typed call safe. It leaves ordinary type, effect and restriction checks in place"
